OL,3,GNEWSAOwners fear 'healthy' dog died due
OL,4,Ato orange substance exposure on
OL,5,Acontaminated land
OL,6,
OL,7,FA couple say their dog may have died
OL,8,Fafter being exposed to an orange
OL,9,Fsubstance on contaminated land during a
OL,10,Fwalk.
OL,12,FDonna and Pete O'Brien noticed Misty's
OL,13,Fhealth deteriorating rapidly after
OL,14,Fwading through a swampy pool close to
OL,15,Fthe Cefn Viaduct near Wrexham.
OL,17,FShe started to cough up blood and then,
OL,18,Faround the time of her death, an
OL,19,Fultrasound revealed that she had a
OL,20,Fheart tumour, which affects just 0.19%
OL,21,Fof dogs.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
