OL,3,GNEWSAOwners fear 'healthy' dog died due
OL,4,Ato orange substance exposure on
OL,5,Acontaminated land
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonna and Pete said they believe it was
OL,8,Flinked to the historical chemical
OL,9,Fdumping that was recently explored in
OL,10,Fthe BBC's Buried documentary, and they
OL,11,Fare calling for the examination of pet
OL,12,Frecords to see if there are any
OL,13,Fclusters of rare illnesses.
